"A button tucks the floating video small. The same button brings it back" = "按一下按鈕可縮小浮動影片，再按一次即可復原";
"A call, a sign-in or a chat asking for a window its size gets one, as in Safari. Pop-up blocking still applies." = "如同 Safari，通話、登入或聊天頁面要求指定大小時，會開啟該尺寸的視窗。彈出式視窗阻擋設定仍然有效。";
"A click fills the rest of the form's empty boxes too. Only your own card is read, and macOS asks first." = "點選後也會填寫表單中其他空白欄位。只會讀取你的個人名片，macOS 會先詢問是否允許。";
"A custom engine has no suggestions to give, so nothing is sent" = "自訂搜尋引擎不提供建議，因此不會傳送你輸入的內容";
"A flat tab strip, and DevTools' colors for the row and the code" = "使用平面的分頁列，並為分頁列和程式碼套用 DevTools 配色";
"A folder with a manifest.json — your own, or one exported from another browser. Reload picks up what you've changed in it since." = "選擇含有 manifest.json 的資料夾，可以是自行開發或從其他瀏覽器匯出的延伸功能。修改後，按一下「重新載入」即可套用。";
"A gentler slide when ⌘S or the window's edge brings the column out or puts it away" = "使用 ⌘S 或將指標移至視窗邊緣時，以較柔和的滑動效果收合側邊欄";
"A key of your own raises it over the app you're in, as Spotlight does" = "使用自訂快速鍵，像 Spotlight 一樣在目前 App 上方叫出網址欄";
"A link opened behind the page waits until you go to its tab" = "在背景開啟的連結會等到你前往該分頁後才載入";
"A link that opens a new tab lands right after the tab it came from" = "從連結開啟的前景分頁會緊鄰其來源分頁";
"A link to a page already open in a tab goes to that tab, not a small window" = "若網頁已在分頁中開啟，前往該分頁，省去開啟小視窗";
"A link you ⌘-click, middle-click or open with Open Link in New Tab comes right after the page in the ⌃Tab switcher, the newest first. Off, it comes after the tab you were on before." = "按住 ⌘ 點選、按滑鼠中鍵或選擇「在新分頁中開啟連結」後，新分頁會在 ⌃Tab 切換器中緊接在來源網頁之後，較新的排在前面。關閉時，新分頁會排在先前使用的分頁之後。";
"A little room around the page, with rounded corners" = "在網頁周圍保留空間，並使用圓角";
"A local socket for testing; its tabs never take over" = "供測試使用的本機 Socket；測試分頁不會搶到前景";
"A page stretches a little past its ends and springs back, as in Safari" = "捲動超出網頁兩端時會略微延伸後回彈，如同 Safari";
"A pin's number again goes back" = "再按一次釘選項目的編號可返回";
"A playing video comes out when you leave its tab, or Search" = "離開分頁或切換到其他 App 時，讓播放中的影片浮起";
"A resting tab lets its page go and comes back where you left it" = "休眠時會釋放網頁，返回分頁時會還原到離開的位置";
