"A save sheet for every download" = "每次下載時都顯示儲存對話框";
"A second engine one key away: Return asks your default, Shift-Return asks this one, with exactly what you typed." = "按 Return 會使用預設搜尋引擎，按 Shift–Return 則會將原樣輸入的內容交給第二個搜尋引擎。";
"A separate set of spaces with its own sign-ins, history and bookmarks, in a window of its own." = "在獨立視窗中建立一組空間，擁有自己的登入狀態、瀏覽記錄和書籤。";
"A separate set of spaces with its own sign-ins, history and bookmarks." = "建立一組獨立的空間，擁有自己的登入狀態、瀏覽記錄和書籤。";
"A site asking for a window at its own size gets one, not a tab" = "網站指定視窗大小時，以該大小開啟獨立視窗";
"A small panel lists every space: a number key opens the link in that space, and Return in the marked one. With Send links to a space on, Always saves a rule for its site." = "面板會列出所有空間。按數字鍵可在對應空間開啟連結；按 Return 會使用標示的空間。開啟「將連結導向指定空間」後，選擇「一律使用」可儲存網站規則。";
"A small switch in its corner makes an article light, dark or as the window is, kept for the next one." = "使用文章角落的開關可選擇淺色、深色或跟隨視窗。選項會沿用至下一篇文章。";
