"A still noise over the glass" = "在玻璃表面加入靜態雜點";
"A tab opened, closed, moved, grouped or renamed in one window is so in the others. Each window shows the page on its own, so the same tab can be open in two windows at once. Private tabs stay in their window, and closing a window leaves its tabs in the others." = "在一個視窗開啟、關閉、移動、分組或重新命名分頁時，其他視窗也會同步。每個視窗獨立顯示網頁，同一分頁可以同時在兩個視窗中開啟。私密分頁保留在原視窗；關閉一個視窗後，其他視窗中的分頁仍會保留。";
"A tab playing sound while you're on another one shows above the sidebar's foot." = "使用其他分頁時，正在播放聲音的分頁會顯示在側邊欄底部上方。";
"A tab sinks a little under the pointer, as in Arc" = "如同 Arc，點按分頁時會稍微下沉";
