"An update to %@" = "%@ 的更新";
"And at the end of the Dock on your other Macs. macOS carries the address to devices signed in to your Apple Account with Handoff on, in System Settings › General › AirDrop & Handoff on a Mac. Never a private tab or a space signed out of the others. Pages handed off from your iPhone open here when Search is your default browser." = "網頁也會顯示於其他 Mac 的 Dock 末端。macOS 會將網址傳給使用相同 Apple 帳號且已開啟「接力」的裝置。在 Mac 的「系統設定」›「一般」›「AirDrop 與接力」中可調整設定。私密分頁與獨立登入的空間不會接力。若 Search 是預設瀏覽器，來自 iPhone 的接力網頁會在這裡開啟。";
"Animations and scrolling in pages at up to 120 frames a second, instead of 60 as in Safari." = "網頁動畫與捲動最高可達每秒 120 格；Safari 的預設為每秒 60 格。";
