"As in Arc: squares for the sites you live in, rows for pages you keep, and a line over the rest with Clear. Right-click a tab to pin it as a row." = "如同 Arc，以方塊顯示常用網站，以列保留個別網頁，並在其餘分頁上方加入「清除」分隔列。在分頁上按右鍵可將它釘選成一列。";
"As in Arc: ⌘-clicking a pin opens a new tab at its address; on a pin that has wandered from its page, the wandered page is kept in loose tabs and the pin gets a fresh tab at home. Off, ⌘-click adds the pin to your tab selection." = "如同 Arc，按住 ⌘ 點按釘選分頁，會在新分頁開啟其網址。若已離開原本釘選的網頁，會將目前頁面保留為一般分頁，並還原釘選分頁的原頁。關閉時，按住 ⌘ 點按可將釘選分頁加入選取項目。";
"As in Safari. Private tabs keep it on" = "運作方式與 Safari 相同。私密分頁一律開啟";
"As links from other apps can (Settings › General): a small window with the page and Open in Search, to read and close or to keep. A page already open in a tab, picked from the list, still goes to its tab." = "如同來自其他 App 的連結（「設定」›「一般」），可在小視窗閱讀後關閉，或選擇「在 Search 中開啟」以保留網頁。若從清單選取已開啟的網頁，仍會前往原分頁。";
"Ask About This Page…" = "詢問此網頁的內容…";
"Ask before ⌘Q or Quit Search closes the browser" = "使用 ⌘Q 或「結束 Search」關閉瀏覽器前先詢問";
"Ask where to save each file" = "每次都詢問檔案的儲存位置";
"Ask which space for links from other apps" = "開啟其他 App 的連結前選擇空間";
"Asked again since you stopped it" = "停止後會再次詢問";
