"Each time one connects, the window asks you first, unless you ticked “Always allow” for it — offered only for Claude Code's own `claude`, signed by Anthropic; kept 30 days at most and 7 after its last use, never with your tabs, and asked again after you press Stop; forget it here. Nothing is drawn over the page: the tab it works in wears a small dot, and Stop is on the column's foot (or the tab strip) and in File › Stop Agent (⌃⌥⌘.) until it goes. It works in tabs of its own; your tabs it can read only if you tick “Let it see my open tabs”, and never uses. It never sees passwords, card numbers, one-time codes, private tabs, cookies or Settings, and can't download or choose files. It connects through a file on this Mac only, never the network: claude mcp add search -- /path/to/Search/search-mcp." = "每次連線時均會先詢問。只有 Anthropic 簽署的 Claude Code「claude」可選擇「一律允許」；授權最長 30 天，且在最後使用 7 天後失效。這項授權不包含你的分頁。按「停止」後，下次連線會重新詢問；你也可在此移除授權。代理使用的分頁會以小圓點標示。連線期間，側邊欄底部（或分頁列）與「檔案」›「停止代理」（⌃⌥⌘.）均可停止操作。代理只在自己的分頁操作；若勾選「讓它查看我開啟的分頁」，只能查看你的分頁，無法操作。代理無法存取密碼、卡號、一次性驗證碼、私密分頁、Cookie 或設定，也無法下載或選取檔案。連線只透過 Mac 本機的檔案，不經網路。指令為 claude mcp add search -- /path/to/Search/search-mcp。";
